# ::tok The large - scale study tour of 100 people from Hong Kong government tourism departments , more than 60 representatives from travel agencies and Hong Kong and Macau cross - border transport operators , and about 30 journalists , travel social media , online media representatives and bloggers / influencers from travel magazines and newspapers respectively visited Macau to learn about Macau 's latest tourism resources . The Hong Kong industry and media brought new ways to travel in Macau to Hong Kong residents and even visitors to Hong Kong . Taking advantage of Hong Kong 's transportation hub , the Hong Kong industry and media brought new ways of traveling in Macau to Hong Kong residents and visitors to Hong Kong .
