# ::tok I think this collection of novels , and its title , is like a form of performance art . What the author wants to express is that love is not only the sorrow and joy of the stage ; the sea is rotten and stony in urban legends ; love is not only the above nor should it be represented by the above ; love is also a life as plain as water . Every day is boring and tasteless , there is also a sense of frustration with life , an escape from reality , and the future is at a loss .
