# ::tok I 've been using the 925-25 . It 's great . I just received the 925-85 . Not to mention the quality of the pen , the style is also very beautiful . The reason I gave it 4 stars is because the pen is a bit heavy and not suitable for fast writing . The cap shakes a bit when adjusting the length of the lead core . My personal opinion : 925-25 is easier than 85 .
