# ::tok First of all , I found a price drop just a few days after I bought it . The review is pretty good . It 's cost - effective . The CPU and video card are good enough for mainstream online games and quite a few large stand - alone computers . The cooling is very good , but the screen is a bit leaking ( common problem with IPS screens ) , the sound quality is not good , and the hard drive is n't good ( I recommend spending some money to add a solid state ) . I took it yesterday and tested the hardware after the sale . There are no problems . The win 8.1 that comes with it is not easy to use . I recommend upgrading to 10 . The seller shipped it very fast . The questions were answered very quickly . The invoice arrived the day after I got it on the computer . Nice , but unfortunately it 's a free gift None at all .
