# ::tok After I bought it , there was no problem with anything else . Even when the software connected , I could n't connect to it . My family is a TP router . After searching the internet , I found that many people have this problem . It took more than two hours to change the router settings . Finally , I used 360 WIFI as a medium to get it done . I called Xiaomi customer service during the period . They had no solution to this problem , so I just asked me to contact Amazon for after - sales service .
